       "text": "I entered the order as you confirmed it: amlodipine 50 mg by mouth once daily (Order ID: ORD-0001).\n\nThe order note records that the dose is above the usual 10 mg/day maximum. It also says you confirmed the dose is intentional and recommends pharmacy verification and close monitoring.\n\nBecause of the dose, I'd suggest:\n- Closely monitoring blood pressure and heart rate, especially in the first hours after each dose.\n- Alerting nursing to hold the dose and call you for hypotension or symptomatic bradycardia or tachycardia.\n- Letting pharmacy know directly so the verification doesn't catch them off guard."
